<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HAG" style="id">- Toma Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Azé</para>
  <para style="toc1">Azé Ná-Sɛʋɛi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Azé</para>
  <para style="toc3">Azé</para>
  <para style="mt1">Azé</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ná-Sɛʋɛi</para>
  <para style="imt">Sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeizuʋɛ ma woo mɔungiti</para>
  <para style="ip">Keela woo naanigɔ ɠa é sɛʋɛi nii zu, nii GALA ge boni GALA goo wo nui Azé ma. Yeeɠɛɠalai niiti Azé ti ɠilagilagi zɔlɔɔni ma, é naati bogɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HAG 1:1">1:1</ref>; <ref loc="HAG 2:1">2:1</ref>, <ref loc="HAG 2:10">10</ref>, <ref loc="HAG 2:20">20</ref></char>). Keela wooiti feeʋɛ zea alu naanigɔ laawu, kona undɔɔlugɔ puufelegɔ (520) ma, aisa Yesu Kilista ʋa zɔlɔɔ. Naama ziɛgi zu Pɛɛlese masadai pilɛ sɔlɔɔni Ɓaɓilɔne masadai ma, tama Pɛɛlese nuiti ti vaani bu ga Zuifuiti ti ɠale ma Zeluzalɛme.</para>
  <para style="ip">Azé ná-keela wooi ɠɛni zelii losu Zuifuiti ma, ga ti ɠaaɓaaʋɛ ti-ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛlɛiti to fai nɔ ma, ti ʋoluave GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo fai ʋa, Maliɠii ná-pɛlɛi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HAG 1:4">1:4</ref></char>). GALA ge ɠɛ naa ɠa é kɛai ti la tuya zɔlɔɔni, ta ta-molo leʋeiti, ta-wulu waaiti kula vai, naa ʋɛɛ lɔɔ ɓɛtɛ vaiti, gola maalɔiɗai. Naama vaiti poluma Izilayɛle nuɓusɛiti ti ɠoloni Maliɠii ʋɛ, ti GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo fai ɠaaɓela. GALA ge minazeɠeni ga GALA sei ʋɛlɛ niinɛi ná-lɛbiyai ɠa wɔɔlɔzu ma mɔungi nɔnɔi ʋa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HAG 2:9">2:9</ref></char>). É minazeɠeni ɓalaa ga toɠa tuya loozu ti ʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="iot">Unsosuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Azé ná-keela woo mɔungi, naa ʋɛɛ nuɓusɛiti ta-wooɠaaʋotegi ʋa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HAG 1:1-15">1:1-15</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Azé ná-keela wooi velesiɛi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HAG 2:1-9">2:1-9</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Azé ná-keela wooi zaʋasiɛi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HAG 2:10-19">2:10-19</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Azé ná-keela wooi naanisiɛi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="HAG 2:20-23">2:20-23</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HAG 1"/>
  <para style="s">GALA sei ʋɛlɛi lo fai ʋolu <optbreak/> ma yeeɠɛɠalai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAG 1:1"/>Masagi Daliyuse ná-masadai ma ɠona felesiɛi ma alu dɔzitasiɛi ma volo mɔungi ma, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni GALA goo wo nui Azé ʋɔ, ga é daazeeli Zuda you zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii Zoloɓaɓɛle ma, Seyalitiyɛle ná-doun zunui, ta zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai Zozuwe ma, Yewosadake ná-doun zunui, é ɠɛ ti ma: <verse eid="HAG 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAG 1:2"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠaa: «Niima nuiti ta ɠɛɛzu ma: ‹Yeeɠɛɠalai la dɛ zeelini, ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi ʋa lo ʋolu.› »<verse eid="HAG 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAG 1:3"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laawooi laazeelini ti ma, GALA goo wo nui Azé ya, é ɠɛ ti ma: <verse eid="HAG 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAG 1:4"/>«Yeeɠɛɠalai ɠa nɛi wo ʋɛ ɓaa, wo zei wa-ʋɛlɛ ʋagɔiti bu, ti maanɛai, tama GALA sei ʋɛlɛi ɠoloɠologai?»<verse eid="HAG 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAG 1:5"/>Naa ɠa é ba, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠaa: «À ɠida bu ga pagɔ, fai é laazu wo ma. <verse eid="HAG 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAG 1:6"/>Wo ani mɔinmɔin fazaga, kɛlɛ tago nɔ ɠa wo sɔlɔɔsu, wa daami wosu, é la kula ɠɛɛzu ga woye, wa ɓɔɔlezu, kɛlɛ é la wo yiilɛizu, wa ɓɔɠɔ maaɠilizu, die ge la zeiɗa wo ma, botiɠɛ nui zalai ɠa ɠɛɛzu, eɠɛ a ɠɛ ʋuuzu ɓɔlɔ zaɠai zu.»<verse eid="HAG 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAG 1:7"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠaa: «À ɠida bu ga pagɔ, fai é laazu wo ma. <verse eid="HAG 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAG 1:8"/>À lɛ gizeiti ma, wo ʋa ga guluiti, wo sèi ʋɛlɛi lo. Naazu kòozu ɠa nɛɛ miná, ná lɛbiyai zɔlɔɔ.» Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠa é boga. <verse eid="HAG 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAG 1:9"/>«Wo ɠigi loni ani mɔinmɔin ba, kɛlɛ tago nɔ ɠa wo sɔlɔɔni wa-ɓalagaʋɛti. Nágoi ɠa wo ʋaani la wa-ʋɛlɛiti bu, kɛlɛ gè laa viilɛi ʋuuni ma, gaaʋala ba. Leeni vaa zu? Tɔɔzei sèi ʋɛlɛi vai ʋa, koloɠologai, tama wo pɛ wa ɠaaɓaazu wa-ʋɛlɛiti nɔ ma,» Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠana. <verse eid="HAG 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAG 1:10"/>«Naa ɠa é kɛɛzu, geeɠɔlɔgi la kɛɛzu, é ʋa duɓui ve, zooi la vaazu bu, ani a ʋa ʋɔnɔ. <verse eid="HAG 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAG 1:11"/>Nà ɠa gè fɔɔvɔgi maaloliga zooi ma, ta gizeiti ma, ta kpalagiti ma, ta leezɛn ɓeleiti, ta wolive ɓeleiti, ta ziinziin ganigiti kpein zooi ma, ta nuɓusɛiti ta suaiti pɛ, é ɠɔkula nuɓusɛiti ta-wotiiti pɛ ma.»<verse eid="HAG 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAG 1:12"/>Zoloɓaɓɛle, Seyalitiyɛle ná-doun zunui, ta zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai Zozuwe, Yewosadake ná-doun zunui, ta nuɓusɛi mɔtaiti pɛ, niiti ti ʋaani ti ɠula duɔlai zu, naati pɛ ti Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, ta-ƓALAGI wooi zeɠeni ga gaamai, niigi GALA goo wo nui Azé boni ti ma. Keela wooi Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ta-ƓALAGI feeni zea, é naa ɠaaɓelani ga pagɔ, nuɓusɛiti ti luani Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋa. <verse eid="HAG 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAG 1:13"/>Naa ʋoluma, Azé, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ná-keelai é teʋeni, é Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi woni ti ma, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Nà ya, nà wo ʋa! Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.» <verse eid="HAG 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAG 1:14"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zɛbɛ niinɛ veeni Zuda you zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii Zoloɓaɓɛle ʋɛ, Seyalitiyɛle ná-doun zunui, ta zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai Zozuwe ʋɛ, Yewosadake ná-doun zunui, ta nuɓusɛi mɔtaiti pɛ bɛ, niiti ti ʋaani ti ɠula duɔlai zu. Ti pɛ ti liini Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii zei ʋɛlɛi wu, ti botii lɔɔzei, <verse eid="HAG 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAG 1:15"/>naa ɠɛɛni, masagi Daliyuse ná-konagi velesiɛi ma alu dɔzitasiɛi ma folo ʋuufelegɔ maazu naanigɔi (24) ma.<verse eid="HAG 1:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HAG 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HAG 2"/>
  <para style="s">GALA sei ʋɛlɛ niinɛi ná-pagi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAG 2:1"/>Masagi Daliyuse ná-masadai ma ɠona felesiɛi ma alugi lɔfelasiɛi ma volo ʋuufelegɔ maazu ɠilagi (21) ma, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI laawooi laazeelini ga GALA goo wo nui Azé maaʋele, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="HAG 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAG 2:2"/>«Nii ɠa ɗa bo Zuda you zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii Zoloɓaɓɛle ma, Seyalitiyɛle ná-doun zunui, ta zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai Zozuwe ma, Yewosadake ná-doun zunui, ta nuɓusɛiti mɔtaiti pɛ ma, niiti ti ʋaani ti ɠula duɔlai zu, ɠɛ ti ma: <verse eid="HAG 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAG 2:3"/>‹Ɓɛ ɠa é wo zaama, é niima ƓALA sei ʋɛlɛi tɛi kaani ná-pada mɔungi zu? Wa pɛtɛsu ɠale niizu? É la mɔ wo ɠaazu ga ani nɔpɛ niizu, kɛlɛ? <verse eid="HAG 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAG 2:4"/>Niizu, zɛbɛzeɠe, Zoloɓaɓɛle. Zɛbɛzeɠe, zalaɠa ɠula ɠundiɠi wolai Zozuwe, Yewosadake ná-doun zunui,› » Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. « ‹À zɛbɛzeɠe, wa ʋe, zooi zu nuɓusɛiti pɛ,› » Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. « ‹À ɓɔɠɔ ve botii ya, mazɔlɔɔ nà wo ʋa,› » Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠana. <verse eid="HAG 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAG 2:5"/>« ‹Gè naama minazeɠegi ɠɛɛni wo ʋɛ, siɛgi zu wo ɠulani la Ezipete yooi ʋa. Nà-Zɛnvui ɠa wo zaama, à mina lua ɲɛgɛlɛin!›<verse eid="HAG 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAG 2:6"/>«Mazɔlɔɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠaa: ‹Naa ʋoluma mɔnɔ, su la mɔ ɠoozazu gè geeɠɔlɔgi ɓali ta zooi, ta kpoloɗɛi ta zooiti. <verse eid="HAG 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAG 2:7"/>Nà zii ɠiligiti pɛ kɛɛzu unga wuulee, ta-naavoloiti pɛ ta ʋa ʋɛ, nà niima ƓALA sei ʋɛlɛi laave ga padai.› Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii ɠa é boga. <verse eid="HAG 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAG 2:8"/>‹Walii kpein ka ga nɔ̀nɔ, zanugi kpein ka ga nɔ̀nɔ,› Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠana. <verse eid="HAG 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAG 2:9"/>‹Naazu, niima ƓALA sei ʋɛlɛ niinɛi ɠa ʋa, é ɗa volo, é leʋe ma mɔungi ʋa.› Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii ɠa é boga. ‹Nà ziilɛigi zei miná.› » Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠana.<verse eid="HAG 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tuyai ma minazeɠegi bogai nuɓusɛiti bɛ, <optbreak/> ti ɠɔzɔai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAG 2:10"/>Masagi Daliyuse ná-masadai ma ɠona felesiɛi, ma alu taaʋuusiɛi ma volo ʋuufelegɔ maazu naanisiɛi (24) ma, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni GALA goo wo nui Azé ʋɔ, é ɠɛ ma: <verse eid="HAG 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAG 2:11"/>«Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠaa: ‹Zalaɠa ɠula nuiti gaazaɠa, ti ɠi fe è ʋɛ niima vaiti su: <verse eid="HAG 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAG 2:12"/>Ni zalaɠa zua ɲadegai ta a ɠɛna nui ta ná-seɠe la, seɠei naa a vɔɔɠuna ɓului ʋa, ɓaa ɠɔnɔgi ta, ɓaa dɔɔi, ɓaa gulɔi, ɓaa daamiani nɔpɛ nɔ, naama anii ɠa ɲade niina ɓaa?› » Zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ti gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Ɓa-o.» <verse eid="HAG 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAG 2:13"/>Azé ti ɠaazaɠani mɔnɔ, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Ni nui ta a ɠɔzɔna, tɔɔzei é vɔɔɠuni nu ʋoomai ta ʋa, ni a vɔɔɠuna daamianigi tanɔpɛ ba, naa ɠa ɠɔzɔ niina ɓaa?» Zalaɠa ɠula nuiti ti gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Ungo, toɠa ɠɔzɔ.» <verse eid="HAG 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAG 2:14"/>Názu ɠa Azé kpɔɛi zeɠeni la, é ɠɛ ti ma: «Deɠɛmu zekana niima nuɓusɛiti ti la, zekana zii nii la gàazu, zekana ta-woti zulɔnɔgi kpein ge la, nii ti feezu bɛ̀ ɠana, kɔzɔʋɛ,» Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana.<verse eid="HAG 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAG 2:15"/>«Niizu, à ɠida lɛɛ bu ga pagɔ, nii é ʋaazu ɠɛɛzu, é zo za ma, é li. Aisa wo ʋa kɔtuiti da ɓɔɠɔ maazu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi lo fai zu, <verse eid="HAG 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAG 2:16"/>leeni ɠa é ɠɛɛni ga woye? Ni nui ɠigi ɠana panisu ʋuufelegɔ (20) ʋa ná-kpalagi zu, puugɔi nɔ ɠa é sɔlɔɔsu ná. Ni nui ɠigi ɠana litɛlɛ ʋuulɔɔlugɔ (50) ʋa ná-dɔɔi ʋɔ bɛ, puufelegɔi (20) nɔ ɠa é sɔlɔɔsu ná. <verse eid="HAG 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAG 2:17"/>Gè vɔɔɠuni wo ʋa, gè wa-wotiiti pɛ ma lɔnɔ fai ɠaaʋala ba, ga siinziin ganigiti ta-zeeɓɛiti, ta sakɔtuiti, kɛlɛ wo la zeɠeni yee ma, wo ʋa ʋa pɔ̀,» Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. <verse eid="HAG 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HAG 2:18"/>« ‹Za ɠa ga alugi laaʋuusiɛi ma volo ʋuufelegɔ maazu naanisiɛi (24), yeei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI zei ʋɛlɛi lo fai lɔɔzeini la. Niizu, à ɠida lɛɛ bu ga pagɔ, nii é ʋaazu ɠɛɛzu, é zo za ma, é li. <verse eid="HAG 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HAG 2:19"/>Kɛbɛ ani zuwu nɔpɛ ge la mɔ wo ya kotaiti su, kɛlɛ? Leezɛn ɓelei, ta kooleɠoole guluiti, ta gelenade guluiti ta wolive wuluiti, tanɔpɛ ge la gwaa woni, ɲɛgɛlɛin. Kɛlɛ é zo za voloi ma, nà nà-tuyai zuwɔɔlɔzu wo ʋɛ.› »<verse eid="HAG 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Minazeɠegi é woni Zoloɓaɓɛle ʋɛ, <optbreak/> Maliɠii yiimazeɠeni la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HAG 2:20"/>Ma volo ná nɔ, alugi ma volo ʋuufelegɔ maazu naanigɔi (24) ma, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɓɔɛni mɔnɔ Azé ʋɔ, ná zeizu velesiɛi zu, é ɠɛni ma: <verse eid="HAG 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HAG 2:21"/>«Ɓɔɛ Zoloɓaɓɛle ʋɔ, Zuda you zɛʋɛ ɠundiɠii, è ɠɛ ma: ‹Nà ʋaazu geeɠɔlɔgi ɲiikpisu ta zooi. <verse eid="HAG 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HAG 2:22"/>Nà ʋaazu masagiti tokasu, gè zii ɠiligiti ta-masadaiti ma zobogiti koloɠolo, gè kɔɔɠɔ wotoloiti daaʋɛ ta ti ɓizɛ nuiti, sooiti ta za, ti ɠɔma nuiti ti ɓɔɠɔ ʋa.› <verse eid="HAG 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HAG 2:23"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠaa: ‹Kɛlɛ naama volo ná, nà boti ɠalivaazu è ma, nà-botiɠɛ nui, Zoloɓaɓɛle, ɗɛi è ga Seyalitiyɛle ná-doun zunui,› » Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wooi ɠana. « ‹Gè yiimazeɠea ga ɗe, gè è ɠɛ ga nà-balaɠaegi, nii nu ɠa ɗa poogi ɠɛ la.› » Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Fai-Pɛ-Maliɠii wooi ɠana.<verse eid="HAG 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="HAG 2"/>
</usx>
